{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeDescentQuadratic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeDescentQuadratic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH4StabilizationRung","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeH3AlgebraLaws"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h4_mulσ₂_eq_mulStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h4_mulσ₂_eq_mulStep","kind":"theorem","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L194-L200","doc":"The merged concrete `H4.mulσ₂` table IS `mulStep` of `descentH4σ₂` —\nthe abstract quadratic re-derives `H4.mulσ₂_hecke`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH4σ₂","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH4σ₂","kind":"def","line":186,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L186-L192","doc":"The n = 4 descent structure for σ₂ on the 24-element S₄ NF basis\n(lengths by word length; step = the σ₂ pairing from the preflight table). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h3_mulσ₁_eq_mulStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h3_mulσ₁_eq_mulStep","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L179-L184","doc":"The merged concrete `H3.mulσ₁` table IS `mulStep` of `descentH3σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH3σ₁","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH3σ₁","kind":"def","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L171-L177","doc":"The n = 3 descent structure for σ₁ (step = the σ₁ pairing\n`0↔2, 1↔4, 3↔5`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h3_mulσ₀_eq_mulStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.h3_mulσ₀_eq_mulStep","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L164-L169","doc":"The merged concrete `H3.mulσ₀` table IS `mulStep` of `descentH3σ₀`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH3σ₀","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.descentH3σ₀","kind":"def","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L155-L162","doc":"The n = 3 descent structure for σ₀ on the NF basis\n`[γ, σ₀, σ₁, L₊, L₋, e⁻]` (lengths `[0,1,1,2,2,3]`; step = the σ₀ pairing\n`0↔1, 2↔3, 4↔5`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_minus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_minus","kind":"theorem","line":124,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L124-L143","doc":"**The e₋ channel at every rank**: for `h = q − q⁻¹`, the vector\n`Mv − q·v` is a `(−q⁻¹)`-eigendirection — the antisymmetric channel.\nTogether with `channel_plus`, the channel pair the archimedean τ-functor\nmust send to `(H^{1,0}, H^{0,1})` now exists at every rank. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_plus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.channel_plus","kind":"theorem","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L109-L122","doc":"**The e₊ channel at every rank**: for `h = q − q⁻¹`, the vector\n`Mv + q⁻¹·v` is a `q`-eigendirection of the generator action — the\nsymmetric channel. Pure algebra from the quadratic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_quadratic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_quadratic","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L85-L103","doc":"**The Hecke quadratic at every rank**: `σ² = h·σ + 1` on the function\nmodule of ANY descent structure. The case split is exactly ascent/descent;\n`t_invol` closes the double step and `len_ne` upgrades ¬descent to ascent.\nSpecializing to a Coxeter system's simple reflections discharges the\n`hecke_quadratic` field content of `HeckeBraidedPresentation` at the action\nlevel for all ranks simultaneously. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_smul","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L78-L83","doc":"`mulStep` is R-homogeneous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep_add","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L71-L76","doc":"`mulStep` is additive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.mulStep","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L65-L69","doc":"The Iwahori–Hecke length-rule action of the generator on the function\nmodule `W → R` (coefficient form): `(v·σ)(u) = v(u·s) + h·v(u)·[s is a\ndescent of u]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.len_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.len_ne","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The step never fixes the rank: `ℓ(u·s) ≠ ℓ(u)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.t_invol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.t_invol","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L59-L59","doc":"The generator is an involution: `u·s·s = u`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.len","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.len","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L57-L57","doc":"The rank (length) function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.t","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.t","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The step map `u ↦ u·s` (right multiplication by the generator). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure.mk","kind":"ctor","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L53-L53","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.HeckeGeneral.DescentStructure","kind":"structure","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/HeckeDescentQuadratic.lean#L48-L61","doc":"A **descent structure** on an index type `W`: an involutive step map\n(right multiplication by a fixed generator) together with a rank function\nthe step never fixes. Every Coxeter system gives one on each simple\nreflection (`t := (· * sᵢ)`, `ℓ := length`); the finite rungs n = 3, 4\ngive them by explicit tables (below). ","signatureChunk":0}]}